# PII: roster CSVs, the Google Workspace export and the raw LinkedIn scrape live in data/
# and never enter git. Only data/README.md is tracked. The rule has to be data/*
# rather than data/, or git never descends far enough for the negation to apply.
data/*
!data/README.md
*.xlsx
